  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Water decomposes at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The percent of water decomposing at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> and 1 bar is _____ (Nearest integer). Equilibrium constant for the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Decomposition of water gives:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;partial pr. at eq.</p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfenced><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is negligible w.r.t 1&nbsp;thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>%</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>",
